WEBVTT

1
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:27.010
â™ªWe are both dim lightâ™ª

2
00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:34.470
â™ªWill time erase us?â™ª

3
00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:40.070
â™ªThose who fade away
in the shadows silentlyâ™ª

4
00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:43.610
â™ªAlso crave a life
under the bright sun openlyâ™ª

5
00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:50.550
â™ªHow can I break free
from the chains of fate?â™ª

6
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:54.350
â™ªWho whispers in my earâ™ª

7
00:00:54.350 --> 00:01:00.270
â™ªThat I'm bound to fall?â™ª

8
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.610
â™ªThen burn meâ™ª

9
00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:08.580
â™ªBurn my stubbornnessâ™ª

10
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:12.120
â™ªThe surging bitternessâ™ª

11
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.550
â™ªThe hot tearsâ™ª

12
00:01:15.870 --> 00:01:19.040
â™ªNobody knowsâ™ª

13
00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.920
â™ªEntangling in the pastâ™ª

14
00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:26.210
â™ªSilence in the darknessâ™ª

15
00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:31.120
â™ªThe dim light finally turnsâ™ª

16
00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.640
[Kill Me Love Me]

17
00:01:32.640 --> 00:01:35.880
â™ªInto the fire of rebirthâ™ª

18
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:39.880
[Episode 16]

19
00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:43.160
[Fanghua Palace]

20
00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:44.560
[Brother]

21
00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.240
[Brother]

22
00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.490
I am so useless.

23
00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:57.770
I promised my brother

24
00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:59.660
I'd protect Mei Lin.

25
00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:01.180
Your Highness.

26
00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:02.580
this is not your fault.

27
00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:03.900
She insisted on leaving.

28
00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:05.130
How could we stop her?

29
00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.860
But General Yin said
Prince Jing took her.

30
00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:12.650
Chagu.

31
00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.900
what if Mei Lin got eaten
by a black bear?

32
00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:16.980
Your Highness.

33
00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:19.260
His Majesty has already
sent people to search for her.

34
00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:20.530
Maybe she's still alive.

35
00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:23.260
Mei Lin doesn't seem
like an ordinary girl.

36
00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:24.930
She won't get killed so easily.

37
00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.300
Right.

38
00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:31.140
She's just missing.

39
00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.180
She's not dead.

40
00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:39.140
No.

41
00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.610
I can't tell my brother.

42
00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:45.460
He's having a hard time in Xiyan too.

43
00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.900
I can't make him worry.

44
00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:50.300
Chagu.

45
00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:53.330
His Majesty will find
Mei Lin alive. right?

46
00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:09.770
Your Majesty. please take your medicine.

47
00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.300
Has the search started?

48
00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:21.530
Remember.

49
00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.180
search for her
under Concubine Yan's name.

50
00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.330
Once Mei Lin is found.

51
00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:27.740
I want to be the first to question her.

52
00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.370
Keep this from Concubine Yan.

53
00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:31.770
Your Majesty.

54
00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:33.490
do you suspect Mei Lin?

55
00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:36.900
With secret guards around Jinghe.

56
00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:39.740
this accident seems suspicious.

57
00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.300
Many from Qingzhou
have always resented the court.

58
00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.210
and Mei Lin is an orphan from there.

59
00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.330
I'm worried

60
00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.300
she has other plans.

61
00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:52.650
In any case.

62
00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:54.210
I want her found.

63
00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:56.140
alive

64
00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:58.530
or dead.

65
00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:00.610
Yes. Your Majesty.

66
00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:04.490
How are the preparations...

67
00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.770
for Jinghe's funeral coming along?

68
00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.330
According to your instructions.

69
00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.370
everything is being handled
as a state funeral.

70
00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:17.580
His Highness has taken care of it all.

71
00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:43.840
[Memorial Tablet
of Prince Murong Jinghe]

72
00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.360
Kneel!

73
00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:49.880
[Tingyun Pavilion]

74
00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:51.040
Prostrate!

75
00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:06.900
Return to the capital immediately

76
00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:08.260
and prepare for my funeral.

77
00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:09.460
For my safety.

78
00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:10.620
make it convincing.

79
00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:12.020
Rise!

80
00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:19.960
[Tingyun Pavilion]

81
00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:20.730
Your Highness.

82
00:05:20.730 --> 00:05:21.900
[Prince Jing's Mansion]
we've been watching for days.

83
00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:22.940
Qingyan

84
00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.460
hasn't sent anyone
to look for his master.

85
00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.210
Could Prince Jing really be dead?

86
00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.020
The two of them always put on a show.

87
00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.970
In any case. I must see
Jinghe's body myself.

88
00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.140
Send more men to search.

89
00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.380
claiming

90
00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.820
the target is Mei Lin.
Jinghe's greatest love.

91
00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:37.060
to avoid raising Father's suspicions.

92
00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.020
Understood.

93
00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:39.620
By the way.

94
00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.770
where is General Yin?

95
00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.260
Of all the officials. only General Yin
hasn't paid respects

96
00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:48.060
or sent offerings.

97
00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:51.580
It seems

98
00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.650
she hasn't accepted Jinghe's death.

99
00:06:05.650 --> 00:06:06.730
You've caught a chill.

100
00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:07.900
Go home

101
00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:09.460
and brew some Tianjing Grass soup.

102
00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:10.260
Got it.

103
00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:16.330
Sir.

104
00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:17.620
could you take a look at her?

105
00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:20.770
You're awake. young lady?

106
00:06:21.140 --> 00:06:22.530
I told you she'd be fine.

107
00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:23.770
but you didn't believe me.

108
00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:24.770
Honestly.

109
00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:26.770
she looks better than you.

110
00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:28.620
Give her Tianjing Grass

111
00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:29.530
for quicker recovery.

112
00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:30.770
Sir.

113
00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:33.700
please check on my brother too.

114
00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.410
I don't need checking.

115
00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:40.140
Your brother

116
00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.700
is quite weak.

117
00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.730
He needs proper rest and care.

118
00:06:44.330 --> 00:06:45.140
You should

119
00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:48.020
have some Tianjing Grass too.

120
00:06:48.020 --> 00:06:50.020
Is this Tianjing Grass a cure-all?

121
00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.290
You outlanders don't understand.

122
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:54.620
Tianjing Grass boosts energy.
enhances circulation.

123
00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.970
and keeps people and livestock healthy.

124
00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:59.380
I'm better at medicine than he is.

125
00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.730
If you're unwell.

126
00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:01.730
let me treat you.

127
00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.020
Luckily. Qingyan left me some medicine.

128
00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:04.700
Since when did you become a physician?

129
00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.140
- Illness makes one a doctor.
- Futian's father!

130
00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.020
Hurry. save him!

131
00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:09.260
Wei is dying!

132
00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.020
Hurry.

133
00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.140
Be careful.

134
00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.530
When did he get sick?

135
00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:16.850
We were hunting in the mountains

136
00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:18.330
and found him unconscious by the stream.

137
00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:18.820
He...

138
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:20.380
He looks like

139
00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:21.210
he has the plague.

140
00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.170
The mountain stream?

141
00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:24.940
It's by the path near Sunset Cliff.

142
00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.700
Is the stream water contaminated?

143
00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.730
Hurry! Tie up these two outlanders!

144
00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:30.820
They're carrying the plague!

145
00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:31.970
Everyone who got sick

146
00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.820
was infected by them!

147
00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.820
They were poisoned from drinking
the mountain stream water?

148
00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.210
Wei is in critical condition.

149
00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.770
He may not survive without an antidote.

150
00:07:52.580 --> 00:07:53.290
This poison.

151
00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:54.730
developed by the Xiyan.

152
00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.820
was used to contaminate upstream water

153
00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.770
and kill many Yan soldiers.

154
00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:00.770
I never thought

155
00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.020
the Crown Prince

156
00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.770
would scapegoat the Xiyan.

157
00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:05.460
Can we save him?

158
00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:07.460
Thunder Duke Vine

159
00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.620
and Qingyan's medicine

160
00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:09.530
can neutralize the poison.

161
00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.380
There's Thunder Duke Vine
in the mountain.

162
00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:20.500
Wait until nightfall.

163
00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:22.330
If we leave now.
we won't have an explanation.

164
00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:24.900
Alright.

165
00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:32.100
What about the other villagers?

166
00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:34.650
The mountain stream water
reaching the village

167
00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:36.100
is much less toxic.

168
00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.690
They should be fine.

169
00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.260
It's always like this.

170
00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:42.050
The common folk. clueless as ever.

171
00:08:42.050 --> 00:08:43.140
always get caught in the crossfire.

172
00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:46.050
They went into hiding
to escape disaster.

173
00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:48.380
yet still. disaster found them.

174
00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.050
There's a fire.

175
00:09:02.170 --> 00:09:03.170
There's a fire.

176
00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:05.020
Mei Lin!

177
00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:06.410
Our house is on fire!

178
00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:12.500
We need to go.

179
00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:14.100
- Let's go!
- Mei Lin...

180
00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:16.570
Come on!

181
00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.740
They jumped out the window! Help!

182
00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:21.770
Stop running!

183
00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:22.740
You two. stop!

184
00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:23.980
Stop right there!

185
00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:24.810
Stop!

186
00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:27.050
Why are you running?

187
00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.380
You're infected with the plague.

188
00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:30.500
so we're burning herbs to ward it off.

189
00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:31.450
If you don't get treated.

190
00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:32.900
you'll endanger yourselves and others!

191
00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.170
We can't let you spread it!

192
00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.220
Exactly! You can't leave!

193
00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.260
Listen to me.

194
00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:37.770
My sister and I aren't infected.

195
00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:38.980
Wei and the villagers

196
00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.380
got sick from the mountain stream water.

197
00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.500
I know how to cure them.

198
00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:42.450
Are you

199
00:09:42.650 --> 00:09:43.810
a physician?

200
00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.260
My sister and I caught the same illness

201
00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:47.530
while we were fleeing.

202
00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.100
A traveling physician saved us

203
00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:49.860
with Thunder Duke Vine.

204
00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:50.930
I'm sure

205
00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:51.860
it can save them too.

206
00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.500
Can Thunder Duke Vine work?

207
00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:54.340
Why...

208
00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:55.570
Why should we believe you?

209
00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:57.650
I can go up the mountain
to gather the herbs.

210
00:09:59.050 --> 00:09:59.860
I'll go with you.

211
00:10:00.770 --> 00:10:01.810
Let your sister go.

212
00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:02.860
You're too weak.

213
00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:03.620
Stay here as a hostage.

214
00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:04.860
I'll go with them.

215
00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.220
Let's go.

216
00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:07.860
Alright. this way.

217
00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:08.650
- Come on.
- Let's go gather the herbs.

218
00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:08.980
Let's go.

219
00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:16.000
[West Suburbs Barracks]

220
00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:50.220
Luomei.

221
00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.050
remember.

222
00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:52.340
protect the nation.

223
00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:56.900
And keep Great Yan safe!

224
00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.170
Your Highness.

225
00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:20.260
General Yin.

226
00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:21.770
I'll practice with you.

227
00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.050
I've lost.

228
00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:40.450
If we were on the battlefield.

229
00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:42.220
my dagger slipping

230
00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.450
would have meant death by your sword.

231
00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.340
Longer weapons have the advantage.

232
00:11:49.860 --> 00:11:51.050
I fought your short dagger
with my long sword.

233
00:11:52.050 --> 00:11:53.100
My victory has no honor.

234
00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:01.050
A defeat is a defeat.

235
00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:03.260
Everything is already decided.

236
00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:08.770
Indeed.

237
00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.340
Everything is already decided.

238
00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:12.770
Luomei.

239
00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:14.690
these past years.

240
00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.690
Jinghe didn't have it easy.

241
00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:18.860
He wanted

242
00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:21.220
to be buried in Qingzhou
with the Weibei Army.

243
00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:23.530
Perhaps this way

244
00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.220
is a release for him.

245
00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:28.980
I'm just sad

246
00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.650
Prince Jing didn't die
on the battlefield.

247
00:12:39.260 --> 00:12:39.810
Forget it.

248
00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:41.650
Let this dagger

249
00:12:41.810 --> 00:12:43.410
be buried with him.

250
00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.020
That dagger

251
00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.140
was actually a gift from me.

252
00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:17.930
It pairs

253
00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:19.690
with this one.

254
00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.260
When we were younger.

255
00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:25.500
I knew of your feelings for him
and didn't dare compete.

256
00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.500
so I

257
00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:28.860
gave it to you through him.

258
00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.220
I never thought I'd get to say this

259
00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:33.340
or

260
00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:35.410
that these two daggers would reunite.

261
00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:42.620
Luomei.

262
00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:46.340
in fact.

263
00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:47.930
it's not just Jinghe

264
00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.650
who can fight by your side. I can too.

265
00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:52.980
I can stand with you
through life and death.

266
00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.140
Will you

267
00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.220
keep this dagger for my sake?

268
00:13:59.260 --> 00:14:00.170
I've already decided

269
00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:02.690
to bury it with Prince Jing.

270
00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:16.380
Though it was a gift from Your Highness.

271
00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.050
it holds

272
00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.170
many memories of my time with him.

273
00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:24.570
Let it carry those memories

274
00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:26.170
and be buried with him.

275
00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.380
I hope Prince Jing

276
00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.380
can once again be
a great general in his next life.

277
00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:42.260
Strike the drums for the general.

278
00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.900
and send his heroic soul off to battle!

279
00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:15.050
Luomei.

280
00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.220
I hope this is the last time

281
00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:19.980
you grieve for him.

282
00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:30.740
Farewell. General!

283
00:15:31.620 --> 00:15:33.690
Farewell. General!

284
00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:29.020
Why aren't they back yet?

285
00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.410
They've been gone too long.

286
00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.290
Is that them over there?

287
00:16:32.620 --> 00:16:33.690
Why aren't they back yet?

288
00:16:33.690 --> 00:16:34.260
I don't know.

289
00:16:37.450 --> 00:16:38.450
It really is them!

290
00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:40.100
They're back!

291
00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:40.980
They're back!

292
00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.020
We found it.

293
00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.140
Here.

294
00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:47.450
Boil the Thunder Duke Vine

295
00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.410
with this medicine.

296
00:16:48.690 --> 00:16:49.500
It'll work faster.

297
00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:51.340
Come on. Let's get to it.

298
00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:53.050
- Right.
- Let's go.

299
00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.650
That's his sleeping powder.

300
00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:23.690
It really worked!

301
00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.930
- Thank you so much. miss!
- What a relief.

302
00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:27.620
Thank you.

303
00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:30.520
[Wei]
Futian's father.

304
00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:31.970
What happened to me?

305
00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:33.490
You were poisoned.

306
00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:35.140
They saved you.

307
00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.730
Thank you. miss.

308
00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:53.250
Avoid heavy labor

309
00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.210
for the next few days.

310
00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:55.730
Madam Wang.

311
00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:56.860
we'll head back now.

312
00:17:57.340 --> 00:17:57.930
Alright.

313
00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:06.970
Who are they?

314
00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:10.300
They're siblings
who fled to our village.

315
00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.210
They're really kind.

316
00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:14.930
especially the girl.

317
00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.300
You've got your eye on her. haven't you?

318
00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:19.620
No. I haven't.

319
00:18:20.650 --> 00:18:21.410
No?

320
00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:22.580
Who would believe that?

321
00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:49.780
Miss Mei Lin!

322
00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:52.060
Miss Mei Lin.

323
00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:52.780
Madam.

324
00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:55.860
There's something I'd like to ask you.

325
00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.450
Are you engaged?

326
00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.450
- No.
- Yes.

327
00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.930
She was engaged.

328
00:19:05.060 --> 00:19:06.650
but her fiance

329
00:19:06.860 --> 00:19:08.650
died while we were fleeing.

330
00:19:08.930 --> 00:19:10.730
Now. it's just the two of us.

331
00:19:10.820 --> 00:19:11.860
After all this time.

332
00:19:11.860 --> 00:19:12.860
as her brother.

333
00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:15.140
I'm reluctant to let her go.

334
00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.970
All women eventually marry.

335
00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:19.540
right?

336
00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:21.780
You wouldn't want
to hold your sister back.

337
00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:23.380
Miss Mei Lin.

338
00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:25.450
there are plenty of good men
in our village.

339
00:19:25.580 --> 00:19:26.380
Take your time to pick.

340
00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:29.340
I'm sure both you and your brother
will be satisfied.

341
00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:32.380
It's up to my brother.

342
00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:34.690
Madam Wang. here's the thing.

343
00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.450
Once Mei Lin gets better.

344
00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:37.730
we'll be on the road

345
00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:38.930
to find our relatives.

346
00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:40.930
It's dangerous out there.

347
00:19:41.300 --> 00:19:43.340
Why don't you stay here?

348
00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.250
Laowozi Village

349
00:19:45.250 --> 00:19:46.540
is safe from war

350
00:19:46.690 --> 00:19:47.900
and government interference.

351
00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.900
with plenty of mountains and streams
to keep you fed.

352
00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:52.170
If you stay. you'll have a good life.

353
00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.410
Think it over.

354
00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.410
We'll think about it.

355
00:19:57.780 --> 00:19:58.540
Think it over. okay?

356
00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:00.380
Madam.

357
00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:02.930
I'm the one who makes the call.

358
00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:04.540
Right.

359
00:20:05.250 --> 00:20:06.380
my brother makes the call.

360
00:20:08.690 --> 00:20:09.250
Alright then.

361
00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.210
I'll go get a bed ready for you two.

362
00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:12.540
A bed?

363
00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:14.930
Oh. right.

364
00:20:15.010 --> 00:20:16.380
You're siblings.

365
00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.410
so you can't share the same bed.

366
00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.060
I'll prepare two beds.

367
00:20:20.170 --> 00:20:20.860
Two.

368
00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.730
Do I really get to make the call?

369
00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.860
I'm not as good at making up stories.

370
00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.650
so you decide.

371
00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.450
If only you'd always listen to me.

372
00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.060
Come with me.

373
00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:43.820
Where?

374
00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:45.250
You'll see when we get there.

375
00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.580
I saw them while gathering herbs
in the mountains.

376
00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:05.970
You brought me here

377
00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:08.380
to watch fireflies with you?

378
00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:10.300
We're here to catch them.

379
00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.010
not just watch.

380
00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.540
You don't know how to catch fireflies?

381
00:21:45.760 --> 00:21:46.840
â™ªI am stillâ™ª

382
00:21:46.840 --> 00:21:51.200
â™ªWandering in your eyesâ™ª

383
00:21:51.680 --> 00:21:56.640
â™ªMarch flowers scent
the hem of my dressâ™ª

384
00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:00.480
â™ªMy worries fall like dustâ™ª

385
00:22:00.520 --> 00:22:03.360
â™ªDrifting toward a sea of longingâ™ª

386
00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:04.400
â™ªHow I look forwardâ™ª

387
00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:08.960
â™ªTo the future with youâ™ª

388
00:22:09.040 --> 00:22:10.120
â™ªI am stillâ™ª

389
00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:12.580
â™ªWaiting through your yearsâ™ª

390
00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:13.060
Don't move.

391
00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:19.880
â™ªWho can truly understand
the joy and sorrow of life?â™ª

392
00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:23.600
â™ªWhen will spring flowers bloom again?â™ª

393
00:22:23.640 --> 00:22:26.400
â™ªThe snow is all over the skyâ™ª

394
00:22:26.440 --> 00:22:27.480
â™ªHow to buryâ™ª

395
00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:32.040
â™ªUnwavering loveâ™ª

396
00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:39.650
You like fireflies?

397
00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:43.450
Don't you like sleeping
with the light on?

398
00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:47.490
The villagers don't
want to waste lamp oil.

399
00:22:48.690 --> 00:22:50.540
so you can hang
this firefly pouch by your bed.

400
00:22:51.100 --> 00:22:52.140
It might help you sleep.

401
00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:55.380
Why are you doing this?

402
00:22:57.250 --> 00:22:58.900
You gave your sleeping powder
to the villagers.

403
00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:01.340
Without it. you can't sleep.

404
00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:03.380
I can't knock you out
every night. right?

405
00:23:05.650 --> 00:23:07.010
I'm the reason they suffer.

406
00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.730
I deserve the consequences.

407
00:23:16.820 --> 00:23:17.780
Hurt your hand breaking the window?

408
00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:21.100
Let's go home and treat it.

409
00:23:22.010 --> 00:23:23.170
It's just a scratch.
Don't worry about it.

410
00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:27.140
For a moment. I thought
they were going to...

411
00:23:30.860 --> 00:23:32.140
Why were you so panicked today?

412
00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.060
You weren't scared at all

413
00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:35.490
when Wenhua Pavilion caught fire.

414
00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:37.540
I was afraid you'd end up
like my father.

415
00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:40.340
During the Qingzhou fire.

416
00:23:40.860 --> 00:23:42.250
he saved me at the cost of his life.

417
00:23:44.380 --> 00:23:46.380
I watched as he was burned alive.

418
00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:47.860
but he never let go of the rope.

419
00:23:47.860 --> 00:23:49.060
Mei. hold on tight!

420
00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:52.860
- Father!
- Mei!

421
00:23:55.170 --> 00:23:55.930
- Father!
- You must...

422
00:23:56.690 --> 00:23:58.780
You must survive!

423
00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:02.580
I used to struggle with sleep.

424
00:24:04.140 --> 00:24:05.450
Even a sliver of light

425
00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:07.010
would give me nightmares.

426
00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:11.060
But now.

427
00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:11.970
I don't anymore.

428
00:24:16.900 --> 00:24:17.900
Both the Qingzhou fire

429
00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:19.380
and Zhongshan poisoning

430
00:24:20.300 --> 00:24:21.100
resulted from

431
00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:24.010
the power struggle for the throne.

432
00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:25.820
You.

433
00:24:26.620 --> 00:24:27.340
Wei.

434
00:24:28.060 --> 00:24:29.210
the Xiyan beauties.

435
00:24:29.580 --> 00:24:31.300
and the 100.000 innocent people

436
00:24:32.210 --> 00:24:34.060
don't deserve any of these consequences.

437
00:24:37.380 --> 00:24:38.860
I once valued
the honor of the Weibei Army

438
00:24:38.860 --> 00:24:40.340
above all.

439
00:24:41.410 --> 00:24:42.170
but now I realize

440
00:24:43.170 --> 00:24:44.250
the suffering of the people

441
00:24:44.780 --> 00:24:46.410
far exceeds anything
the Weibei Army went through.

442
00:24:48.170 --> 00:24:49.210
What's done is done.

443
00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:51.340
We have to look ahead.

444
00:24:54.620 --> 00:24:56.690
We both need to learn
to wake up from our nightmares.

445
00:25:02.820 --> 00:25:03.210
Let's go.

446
00:25:20.580 --> 00:25:21.580
It makes the room much brighter.

447
00:25:23.970 --> 00:25:24.970
Sleep well.

448
00:25:37.140 --> 00:25:39.170
Even a lifetime of atonement

449
00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:41.860
may never be enough.

450
00:25:53.820 --> 00:25:55.060
What?

451
00:25:56.820 --> 00:25:58.010
The Crown Prince

452
00:25:59.580 --> 00:26:01.450
is also searching for Mei Lin?

453
00:26:02.060 --> 00:26:05.100
His Highness often says in private

454
00:26:05.210 --> 00:26:06.450
that he doesn't believe

455
00:26:07.300 --> 00:26:08.540
Prince Jing's death

456
00:26:09.380 --> 00:26:10.930
was an accident.

457
00:26:12.300 --> 00:26:12.860
Liu Zhong.

458
00:26:14.490 --> 00:26:15.780
what do you think?

459
00:26:19.450 --> 00:26:20.540
Speak freely.

460
00:26:21.860 --> 00:26:22.580
Your Majesty.

461
00:26:23.820 --> 00:26:25.010
in my humble opinion.

462
00:26:25.540 --> 00:26:27.490
His Highness and Your Majesty

463
00:26:27.780 --> 00:26:29.450
are thinking the same thing.

464
00:26:30.450 --> 00:26:33.490
Both General Yin
and Princess Hengyang's son

465
00:26:33.650 --> 00:26:37.210
saw Mei Lin at Lushan Hunting Ground.

466
00:26:38.170 --> 00:26:41.380
I'm afraid the truth
behind Prince Jing's death

467
00:26:41.450 --> 00:26:43.580
can only be uncovered

468
00:26:43.900 --> 00:26:45.300
when we find Mei Lin.

469
00:26:47.010 --> 00:26:48.100
You sly old fox.

470
00:26:48.100 --> 00:26:49.170
you're just circling around!

471
00:26:55.650 --> 00:26:56.900
Send some Imperial Guards

472
00:26:57.540 --> 00:26:58.820
to secretly follow
the Crown Prince's men.

473
00:26:59.450 --> 00:27:01.170
We must find Mei Lin

474
00:27:02.210 --> 00:27:03.250
before they do.

475
00:27:05.010 --> 00:27:06.540
Your Majesty. do you mean...?

476
00:27:07.540 --> 00:27:09.730
I suspect the Crown Prince
is searching for Mei Lin

477
00:27:11.650 --> 00:27:13.580
to kill her.

478
00:27:14.860 --> 00:27:15.540
Your Majesty.

479
00:27:16.580 --> 00:27:17.620
are you implying

480
00:27:18.250 --> 00:27:19.450
that His Highness

481
00:27:19.900 --> 00:27:21.860
was behind Prince Jing's death?

482
00:27:33.170 --> 00:27:33.970
Liu Zhong.

483
00:27:36.490 --> 00:27:38.170
do you think it's my bad karma

484
00:27:40.410 --> 00:27:41.690
that my sons

485
00:27:43.730 --> 00:27:45.650
have come to this?

486
00:27:47.730 --> 00:27:48.620
Your Majesty.

487
00:27:49.780 --> 00:27:52.100
Prince Jing is already gone.

488
00:27:52.620 --> 00:27:54.250
Even if you uncover the truth.

489
00:27:54.490 --> 00:27:56.140
what good would it do?

490
00:27:58.490 --> 00:27:59.250
Jinghe.

491
00:28:02.210 --> 00:28:03.140
Empress Dejia.

492
00:28:06.620 --> 00:28:08.250
don't blame me.

493
00:28:10.620 --> 00:28:11.970
Born into the imperial family.

494
00:28:14.010 --> 00:28:16.170
this is his fate.

495
00:28:20.340 --> 00:28:22.340
I've walked this same path myself.

496
00:28:24.730 --> 00:28:26.410
As long as the Crown Prince

497
00:28:28.170 --> 00:28:30.450
doesn't jeopardize the nation.

498
00:28:32.490 --> 00:28:34.860
I cannot strip him of his position.

499
00:28:36.340 --> 00:28:37.250
But I must

500
00:28:38.140 --> 00:28:40.690
know the truth!

501
00:28:42.450 --> 00:28:43.100
Your Highness?

502
00:28:44.100 --> 00:28:45.170
What brings you here?

503
00:28:45.540 --> 00:28:46.140
Where is everyone?

504
00:28:46.250 --> 00:28:47.780
Why didn't you report
Her Highness's arrival?

505
00:28:49.340 --> 00:28:50.250
I acknowledge my mistake.

506
00:28:50.580 --> 00:28:51.170
I...

507
00:28:51.580 --> 00:28:52.730
I've overstepped my bounds.

508
00:28:53.340 --> 00:28:53.650
I just

509
00:28:53.930 --> 00:28:56.210
wanted to bring some ginseng soup
to Your Majesty.

510
00:29:09.860 --> 00:29:11.210
The filth and gossip in the palace

511
00:29:12.410 --> 00:29:13.490
are none of your concern.

512
00:29:14.900 --> 00:29:15.580
Don't listen to it.

513
00:29:16.620 --> 00:29:17.540
and don't overthink things.

514
00:29:20.820 --> 00:29:23.250
Yes. I understand.

515
00:29:31.450 --> 00:29:31.930
Liu Zhong.

516
00:29:31.930 --> 00:29:32.930
- Yes. Your Majesty.
- Where's the burn ointment?

517
00:29:33.210 --> 00:29:33.970
I'll fetch it right away.

518
00:29:40.690 --> 00:29:42.210
I know you're worried about Mei Lin.

519
00:29:43.170 --> 00:29:44.650
I've already sent people
to search for her.

520
00:29:46.170 --> 00:29:47.820
If she had nothing to do
with Jinghe's death.

521
00:29:48.210 --> 00:29:49.650
I wouldn't harm her.

522
00:29:50.410 --> 00:29:51.540
But if she was involved.

523
00:29:53.100 --> 00:29:54.490
I don't want you to interfere.

524
00:29:55.730 --> 00:29:56.730
Do you understand?

525
00:29:58.820 --> 00:29:59.490
Yes.

526
00:30:01.100 --> 00:30:01.690
Your Majesty.

527
00:30:08.780 --> 00:30:09.650
Did I scare you?

528
00:30:13.820 --> 00:30:15.140
Next time I'm angry.

529
00:30:16.380 --> 00:30:17.300
stay away

530
00:30:18.100 --> 00:30:19.010
from me.

531
00:30:24.170 --> 00:30:25.650
We might receive good news

532
00:30:27.340 --> 00:30:29.340
from your brother in Xiyan soon.

533
00:30:36.210 --> 00:30:37.010
No need to be scared.

534
00:30:39.580 --> 00:30:40.580
Go back and rest.

535
00:30:43.580 --> 00:30:44.140
Yes. Your Majesty.

536
00:31:15.450 --> 00:31:17.170
Under the divine envoys' watch.

537
00:31:17.730 --> 00:31:19.340
His Majesty fulfills heaven's will.

538
00:31:19.820 --> 00:31:21.970
blessing Xiyan with peace. prosperity.
and abundant resources

539
00:31:22.250 --> 00:31:23.490
through all seasons.

540
00:31:23.860 --> 00:31:25.010
The people of Xiyan

541
00:31:25.340 --> 00:31:26.970
give thanks to the heavens
and honor our King!

542
00:31:35.540 --> 00:31:36.450
Rise.

543
00:31:40.340 --> 00:31:41.650
The gods revealed in a dream
to His Majesty

544
00:31:42.210 --> 00:31:45.010
that the Left Divine Envoy. Sun Kunlun.
was born into the royal family of Xiyan.

545
00:31:45.780 --> 00:31:47.340
Today. we have
the Second Prince. Yue Chu.

546
00:31:47.690 --> 00:31:48.970
and the Sixth Prince. Yue Qin.

547
00:31:49.410 --> 00:31:50.650
both wise and brave.

548
00:31:51.100 --> 00:31:52.540
We beseech the gods for a clear sign

549
00:31:52.820 --> 00:31:53.970
to appoint the rightful heir

550
00:31:54.250 --> 00:31:55.970
and bless Xiyan
for a thousand generations!

551
00:32:32.450 --> 00:32:34.060
I have seen the will of the gods.

552
00:32:35.170 --> 00:32:37.540
You are the chosen one.

553
00:32:40.410 --> 00:32:42.450
The Second Prince tampered
with the altar.

554
00:32:43.970 --> 00:32:45.410
I will set everything back

555
00:32:46.010 --> 00:32:47.060
on the right track.

556
00:33:10.360 --> 00:33:12.360
[Mingju. General of Xiyan]

557
00:33:17.210 --> 00:33:18.340
It seems the Sixth Prince

558
00:33:18.730 --> 00:33:20.410
is the reincarnation of the Sun Kunlun!

559
00:33:21.410 --> 00:33:22.580
You...!

560
00:33:24.620 --> 00:33:25.250
Father.

561
00:33:25.450 --> 00:33:26.690
the High Priest and Yue Qin
are colluding.

562
00:33:26.900 --> 00:33:27.450
They've

563
00:33:27.450 --> 00:33:28.210
tricked you!

564
00:33:29.100 --> 00:33:29.690
Father.

565
00:33:30.100 --> 00:33:31.780
I would never dare
interfere with divine will.

566
00:33:32.620 --> 00:33:34.060
The Second Prince
disrespects the divine envoys

567
00:33:34.060 --> 00:33:35.170
and will face heavenly punishment.

